## Interface: 11507, 16001
## Title: PadKeys - Radial
## Notes: Radials in the style of Blizzard's gamepad radial, in combat too: actions (G by combat, professions while resting, Cmd+G), markers (Shift+G), main menu (Ctrl+G), consumables from your bags (5); a faint copy follows the mouse and lights the segment you need. Needs PadKeys.
